﻿They didn't play mahjong!?

00:26:20.470 --> 00:26:21.100
﻿Right.

00:26:21.760 --> 00:26:23.260
﻿According to our investigation...

00:26:23.260 --> 00:26:26.430
﻿The six victims never even played mahjong.

00:26:27.180 --> 00:26:30.900
﻿Sorry to say, Mouri-kun's deduction was a miss.

00:26:32.270 --> 00:26:34.360
