00:26:57.760 --> 00:26:58.840
﻿He solved another case.

00:27:03.470 --> 00:27:04.060
﻿Takagi-kun!

00:27:06.100 --> 00:27:07.060
﻿Sorry, I slipped...

00:27:07.730 --> 00:27:09.230
﻿What's this about?

00:27:09.690 --> 00:27:11.190
As per his request...

00:27:11.190 --> 00:27:14.070
﻿We've been withholding information regarding his involvement.

00:27:14.730 --> 00:27:15.780
﻿I see.

00:27:17.230 --> 00:27:19.030
﻿Such a humble person.

00:27:19.450 --> 00:27:21.570
﻿He's changed, for some reason.

00:27:22.240 --> 00:27:23.740
﻿In the past...

00:27:23.740 --> 00:27:25.490
﻿He was actually quite a show-off.

00:27:35.500 --> 00:27:38.090
﻿Taking two days off from school
﻿didn't net you much progress, huh?

00:27:40.170 --> 00:27:40.970
﻿Could say that.

00:27:42.340 --> 00:27:45.300
﻿And what about the correlation between the
﻿mahjong tiles and the alphabet letters?

00:27:45.300 --> 00:27:47.220
﻿Still haven't worked it out.

00:27:47.640 --> 00:27:49.850
﻿The same goes for "Tanabata... Kyo."

00:27:51.600 --> 00:27:53.190
﻿Amazing, Mitsuhiko-kun!

00:27:53.190 --> 00:27:53.940
﻿So good!

00:27:54.520 --> 00:27:55.900
﻿That's a rhinoceros beetle, right?

00:27:56.230 --> 00:27:57.110
﻿Yeah.

00:27:57.110 --> 00:27:59.530
﻿I'm pretty good at things like this.

00:27:59.530 --> 00:28:01.950
﻿But some people are so cruel...

00:28:01.950 --> 00:28:03.740
﻿Putting tape on beetles like that.

00:28:04.570 --> 00:28:05.660
﻿You mean Orihime-san, right?

00:28:06.410 --> 00:28:08.490
﻿I wonder who did it...

00:28:08.490 --> 00:28:09.500
﻿It really is...

00:28:11.500 --> 00:28:13.210
﻿Say, Genta-kun...

00:28:13.210 --> 00:28:14.630
﻿The thing you're making...

00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:15.710
﻿Is that a snake?

00:28:15.920 --> 00:28:17.920
﻿Can't you tell?

00:28:17.920 --> 00:28:18.960
﻿It's an eel!

00:28:18.960 --> 00:28:20.460
﻿E-E-L!

00:28:24.180 --> 00:28:25.970
﻿Again with the eel?

00:28:25.970 --> 00:28:28.810
﻿Genta-kun, you really love eels, don't you?

00:28:28.810 --> 00:28:32.690
﻿You even wrote it on your Tanabata wish card.

00:28:36.560 --> 00:28:37.610
﻿Come to think of it...

00:28:37.610 --> 00:28:39.320
﻿Tanabata is tomorrow.

00:28:42.530 --> 00:28:44.070
﻿﻿Tanabata...

00:28:44.070 --> 00:28:45.070
﻿﻿Kyo...

00:28:46.070 --> 00:28:47.490
﻿What's that supposed to mean?

00:28:53.040 --> 00:28:54.080
﻿That's a no-no.

00:28:54.080 --> 00:28:55.210
﻿You should've turned it off before the...

00:28:55.210 --> 00:28:55.750
﻿Excuse me.

00:28:56.330 --> 00:28:56.790
﻿It's me.

00:29:01.510 --> 00:29:02.380
﻿And?

00:29:03.420 --> 00:29:03.970
﻿What!?

00:29:04.680 --> 00:29:05.510
﻿Roger that!

00:29:07.090 --> 00:29:07.890
﻿Good news.

00:29:09.180 --> 00:29:13.980
﻿I was told that a man suspected to be our
﻿serial killer might show up in Beika City.

00:29:14.560 --> 00:29:15.350
﻿What now?

00:29:16.520 --> 00:29:18.810
﻿Fukase Minoru, age 27.

00:29:20.650 --> 00:29:24.030
﻿His connection to Jinno Shuuhei-san,
 ﻿the one who was killed on usui pass...

00:29:24.030 --> 00:29:26.780
﻿Was that he stabbed and wounded him once with a knife.

00:29:26.780 --> 00:29:27.990
He's been wanted since a year ago.

00:29:28.910 --> 00:29:31.370
﻿I've had my subordinates monitoring his girlfriend.

00:29:31.990 --> 00:29:34.160
﻿I'm told she boarded a train from Nagano to Tokyo...

00:29:34.160 --> 00:29:36.210
﻿And just arrived at Beika Station.

00:29:36.960 --> 00:29:38.790
﻿Yoshii Risa, age 21.

00:29:39.210 --> 00:29:40.960
﻿She works at a snack bar in Nagano.

00:29:43.340 --> 00:29:43.670
﻿And?

00:29:44.340 --> 00:29:47.340
﻿What was this Fukase guy's motive for stabbing Jinno-san?

00:29:47.970 --> 00:29:50.760
﻿While they were lining up at the
﻿Tropical Land amusement park...

00:29:50.760 --> 00:29:54.890
﻿Jinno-san warned him not to smoke
﻿which caused him to fly into a rage.

00:29:54.890 --> 00:29:56.140
﻿Tropical Land...

00:29:58.730 --> 00:29:59.270
﻿Takagi-kun?

00:29:59.690 --> 00:30:00.770
﻿What came to mind?

00:30:01.860 --> 00:30:02.610
﻿Could it be...

00:30:03.320 --> 00:30:04.400
﻿Could it be that...

00:30:04.400 --> 00:30:07.570
﻿The victims were all waiting in the same line?

00:30:08.110 --> 00:30:08.740
﻿What?

00:30:09.320 --> 00:30:10.740
﻿Details, now.

00:30:10.740 --> 00:30:11.450
﻿Yes, sir.

00:30:13.410 --> 00:30:16.370
﻿There are two variations of the
﻿mahjong tiles found near our victims.

00:30:16.910 --> 00:30:21.460
﻿Jinno-san's was 1-Pin, and the others had 7-Pins.

00:30:23.380 --> 00:30:28.180
﻿And, if we place them into the circles
﻿as indicated by the red marks...

00:30:29.340 --> 00:30:34.270
﻿The victims may have lined up this way, right?

00:30:34.970 --> 00:30:36.310
﻿I see.

00:30:36.310 --> 00:30:37.390
﻿Then, that Fukase...

00:30:38.190 --> 00:30:39.560
﻿All right, Megure.

00:30:39.560 --> 00:30:42.150
﻿Get your men and go along with Inspector Yamato.

00:30:53.080 --> 00:30:54.160
﻿Damn...

00:30:54.160 --> 00:30:55.870
﻿Why'd you have to come along too?

00:30:56.450 --> 00:30:59.370
﻿For once, I wanted to ride on the capital highway!

00:31:00.250 --> 00:31:01.330
﻿Inspector Yamato, what about you?

00:31:01.330 --> 00:31:02.040
﻿Say, say!

00:31:47.960 --> 00:31:48.840
﻿All right.

00:31:48.840 --> 00:31:50.930
﻿Split up and begin the stakeout, just as we planned.

00:32:13.570 --> 00:32:14.780
﻿﻿She's the suspect?

00:32:16.030 --> 00:32:17.620
﻿﻿Or, could she be...

00:32:21.830 --> 00:32:22.790
﻿Minoru!

00:32:25.500 --> 00:32:26.670
﻿Fukase is in sight.

00:32:27.250 --> 00:32:29.000
﻿Remain at your posts.

00:32:29.000 --> 00:32:30.630
﻿Do not alert the suspect.

00:32:31.010 --> 00:32:31.970
﻿Hurry, hurry!

00:32:38.970 --> 00:32:41.060
﻿The game shop's on the 7th floor, right?

00:32:41.060 --> 00:32:41.850
﻿Yeah.

00:32:41.850 --> 00:32:44.020
﻿And let's get some ice cream before we go home.

00:32:44.020 --> 00:32:45.900
﻿I'm gonna get a vanilla and chocolate double scoop!

00:32:47.230 --> 00:32:48.070
Inspector!

00:32:48.070 --> 00:32:49.150
﻿We have children around Fukase!

00:32:49.780 --> 00:32:50.730
﻿Remain calm.

00:32:50.730 --> 00:32:53.400
﻿Once the children are gone, we'll make our move.

00:32:53.400 --> 00:32:53.990
﻿﻿Roger.

00:33:03.750 --> 00:33:04.620
﻿Which floor is this?

00:33:04.620 --> 00:33:05.750
﻿I think we're close.

00:33:08.090 --> 00:33:09.090
﻿Suspect has passed 5th floor.

00:33:11.510 --> 00:33:12.720
﻿We're almost to the 7th.

00:33:13.880 --> 00:33:15.220
﻿Now, secure him.

00:33:15.550 --> 00:33:16.050
﻿Roger.

00:33:17.300 --> 00:33:18.470
﻿Roger that!

00:33:18.930 --> 00:33:19.510
﻿Wait!

00:33:31.940 --> 00:33:32.900
﻿That idiot!

00:33:33.150 --> 00:33:33.990
﻿Fukase!

00:33:33.990 --> 00:33:35.070
﻿Don't move!

00:33:35.070 --> 00:33:35.820
﻿Police!

00:33:36.910 --> 00:33:37.950
﻿There's nowhere to run!

00:33:38.410 --> 00:33:39.070
﻿Shit!

00:33:44.040 --> 00:33:44.830
﻿Stop it, Fukase!

00:33:45.750 --> 00:33:46.790
﻿Stay away!

00:33:46.790 --> 00:33:48.960
﻿Any closer and I'll kill her!

00:33:49.170 --> 00:33:49.920
﻿Damn...

00:34:05.770 --> 00:34:06.440
﻿Don't move!

00:34:07.190 --> 00:34:08.980
﻿I'll stab her if you dare!

00:34:10.150 --> 00:34:10.980
﻿Stop it!

00:34:10.980 --> 00:34:12.980
﻿You can't get away with this!

00:34:13.190 --> 00:34:13.820
﻿Shut up!

00:34:14.400 --> 00:34:15.320
﻿Stay away!

00:34:29.790 --> 00:34:30.830
﻿Stay away!

00:34:35.460 --> 00:34:36.630
﻿You all, stay away!

00:34:37.760 --> 00:34:39.090
﻿I get it, just calm down!

00:35:17.630 --> 00:35:19.050
﻿What a waste of our time, punk.

00:35:21.140 --> 00:35:22.300
﻿He's unconscious.

00:35:22.930 --> 00:35:23.720
﻿But why?

00:35:24.600 --> 00:35:25.510
﻿Stay away...

00:35:28.180 --> 00:35:29.480
﻿﻿Stay away from Minoru...

00:35:31.600 --> 00:35:33.020
﻿﻿Stay away from Minoru.

00:35:33.650 --> 00:35:34.730
﻿Don't do something rash, Risa-san.

00:35:35.610 --> 00:35:36.570
﻿Please drop the knife.

00:35:38.690 --> 00:35:41.320
﻿This won't change anything.

00:35:41.320 --> 00:35:42.280
﻿Please, drop the knife.

00:35:42.700 --> 00:35:43.870
﻿I won't...

00:35:43.870 --> 00:35:44.530
﻿No!

00:35:46.330 --> 00:35:47.660
﻿Stay away from Minoru!

00:36:04.300 --> 00:36:05.510
﻿All right...

00:36:05.510 --> 00:36:06.930
﻿That's enough, Risa-san...

00:36:07.930 --> 00:36:10.640
﻿You don't want to commit another crime...

00:36:11.730 --> 00:36:12.520
﻿I'm sorry...

00:36:14.980 --> 00:36:16.110
﻿Are you all right, Inspector?

00:36:16.650 --> 00:36:18.360
﻿No need to worry...

00:36:18.360 --> 00:36:21.400
﻿My belly fat has some thickness to it.

00:36:21.490 --> 00:36:22.150
I'm sorry...

00:36:23.160 --> 00:36:24.700
﻿I'm truly sorry.

00:36:24.700 --> 00:36:26.120
﻿I dropped my guard.

00:36:26.620 --> 00:36:27.830
﻿What?

00:36:27.830 --> 00:36:32.250
﻿I can't let another prefecture's officer
﻿get hurt in my jurisdiction, now can I?

00:36:39.710 --> 00:36:40.300
﻿What is it?

00:36:41.800 --> 00:36:44.010
﻿That female hostage just then—she's...

00:36:44.010 --> 00:36:44.680
﻿Gone?

00:37:00.150 --> 00:37:01.110
﻿Is it all right?

00:37:01.110 --> 00:37:02.530
﻿To walk away like that.

00:37:03.610 --> 00:37:05.990
﻿Isn't there something you want from that guy?

00:37:06.570 --> 00:37:07.280
﻿Vermouth.

00:37:09.580 --> 00:37:11.410
﻿There's nothing that can be done.

00:37:11.410 --> 00:37:13.000
﻿And didn't you want me to leave like that?

00:37:13.660 --> 00:37:14.790
﻿Not to mention.

00:37:14.790 --> 00:37:16.960
﻿That man likely isn't the killer.

00:37:17.420 --> 00:37:18.250
﻿Yeah.

00:37:18.250 --> 00:37:19.420
﻿That's true.

00:37:21.960 --> 00:37:23.470
﻿Take it easy, lady!

00:37:23.470 --> 00:37:25.380
﻿I have a hurt right shoulder...

00:37:26.340 --> 00:37:27.720
﻿Your right shoulder's hurt?

00:37:28.550 --> 00:37:30.060
﻿Come to think of it, just then, you...

00:37:30.350 --> 00:37:31.220
﻿﻿Stay away!

00:37:32.930 --> 00:37:36.520
﻿A man who can't even raise his right arm
﻿to use a knife can't be our assailant.

00:37:37.100 --> 00:37:39.560
﻿Assuming he didn't hurt it after
﻿committing the crime, that is.

00:37:41.860 --> 00:37:42.860
﻿Beyond that...

00:37:42.860 --> 00:37:44.780
﻿I'm impressed you managed to figure me out.

00:37:46.110 --> 00:37:46.860
﻿Your ankle.

00:37:47.360 --> 00:37:47.910
﻿Ankle?

00:37:49.830 --> 00:37:51.700
﻿There was a bulge near your right ankle.

00:37:52.370 --> 00:37:54.370
﻿You have a gun concealed there, no?

00:37:55.500 --> 00:37:56.540
﻿And...

00:37:56.540 --> 00:37:59.750
﻿Even after that guy wounded your face with a knife...

00:37:59.750 --> 00:38:01.210
﻿I don't see any blood seeping from it.

00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:04.510
Jeez...

00:38:09.680 --> 00:38:12.180
﻿I guess I'll have to make a blood-seeping mask next time, huh?

00:38:12.850 --> 00:38:17.310
﻿I think you purposely made yourself his hostage...

00:38:17.310 --> 00:38:23.070
﻿And planned to utilize your gun to turn the tables
﻿on him once you were out of the police's sight.

00:38:24.230 --> 00:38:27.450
﻿I doubt you would really put your gun to use, anyway.

00:38:27.450 --> 00:38:30.410
﻿And I didn't expect to receive a compliment from you.

00:38:31.030 --> 00:38:34.910
﻿Why is your organization following this serial murder case?

00:38:36.040 --> 00:38:38.290
﻿My, how straightforward of you.

00:38:38.710 --> 00:38:39.460
﻿Spit it out.

00:38:40.210 --> 00:38:41.170
﻿NOC.

00:38:41.920 --> 00:38:43.710
﻿NOC?

00:38:43.710 --> 00:38:44.880
﻿Non-official cover...

00:38:46.010 --> 00:38:49.760
﻿A member of yours working undercover
﻿as a civilian became one of the victims?

00:38:49.760 --> 00:38:50.510
﻿Right.

00:38:50.510 --> 00:38:53.760
﻿That NOC, perhaps seeking some sort of insurance...

00:38:53.760 --> 00:38:58.850
﻿Carried a memory card containing our entire NOC list.

00:38:59.480 --> 00:39:02.110
﻿The Organization had planned to get rid of them shortly.

00:39:02.690 --> 00:39:03.730
﻿However...

00:39:04.860 --> 00:39:07.690
﻿That person was killed by someone else first.

00:39:10.160 --> 00:39:11.070
﻿Correct.

00:39:11.070 --> 00:39:12.530
﻿And now, their killer...

00:39:12.530 --> 00:39:15.290
Has made off with the memory card.

00:39:15.290 --> 00:39:17.160
﻿Most likely unknowingly.

00:39:17.500 --> 00:39:19.120
﻿I see.

00:39:19.120 --> 00:39:24.040
﻿It would be bad for you should the police
﻿catch the killer and look into that database.

00:39:26.250 --> 00:39:29.760
﻿Wait, the fact that you're here means
﻿the NOC was at the conference...

00:39:30.300 --> 00:39:31.220
﻿No, that's not it...

00:39:32.180 --> 00:39:35.260
﻿You had one of your partners disguise as an officer.

00:39:35.970 --> 00:39:38.850
﻿That's why you infiltrated the conference, was it not?

00:39:39.430 --> 00:39:42.400
﻿You wanted to ensure that your
﻿partner's disguise was still airtight!

00:39:42.900 --> 00:39:45.820
﻿And if it weren't, you would've
﻿continued your own infiltration.

00:39:47.400 --> 00:39:48.240
Who is it!?

00:39:48.530 --> 00:39:49.900
﻿Who are they disguised as!?

00:39:49.900 --> 00:39:51.320
﻿Is the real officer safe!?

00:39:53.910 --> 00:39:55.910
﻿Our conversation has come to an end.

00:39:55.910 --> 00:39:58.120
﻿It's on you to solve the rest.

00:39:59.500 --> 00:40:01.580
﻿Their codename is... Irish.

00:40:02.420 --> 00:40:03.540
﻿Irish...

00:40:03.920 --> 00:40:05.000
﻿Right.

00:40:05.000 --> 00:40:07.460
﻿Irish whiskey is nicely distilled, with a mild taste.

00:40:08.800 --> 00:40:10.510
﻿Excuse me, security guard?

00:40:11.050 --> 00:40:12.760
﻿This kid looks lost.

00:40:13.430 --> 00:40:14.430
﻿He's lost?

00:40:14.890 --> 00:40:15.390
﻿No...

00:40:17.100 --> 00:40:18.600
﻿Good luck.

00:40:18.600 --> 00:40:19.980
﻿I wish you the best.

00:40:27.860 --> 00:40:28.980
﻿Damn!

00:40:33.450 --> 00:40:34.660
﻿It's me, Megure.

00:40:35.530 --> 00:40:35.910
﻿Superintendent?

00:40:36.870 --> 00:40:43.960
We just got a call from a painter named Shindou Sumire
 ﻿saying she has a clue that may lead to our suspect.

00:40:44.790 --> 00:40:46.590
﻿The address is in Hachioji City.

00:40:47.250 --> 00:40:48.340
﻿Yes.

00:40:48.340 --> 00:40:49.210
﻿Yes, sir.

00:40:49.210 --> 00:40:50.090
﻿Understood.

00:40:50.880 --> 00:40:52.300
﻿Satou! Takagi!

00:40:52.630 --> 00:40:54.680
﻿Head to Hachioji now!

00:40:54.680 --> 00:40:55.050
Yes, sir!

00:40:58.890 --> 00:40:59.350
﻿Got it.

00:40:59.350 --> 00:41:00.720
﻿Shindou Sumire, you say?

00:41:02.310 --> 00:41:04.100
﻿Not good, Partner.

00:41:04.100 --> 00:41:05.230
﻿If we head this way...

00:41:05.230 --> 00:41:08.440
Even if we are ahead of the cops, we'll still
 ﻿get caught before we finish our target off.

00:41:09.900 --> 00:41:11.320
﻿We won't be running into the cops.

00:41:13.400 --> 00:41:14.070
﻿It's me.

00:41:21.790 --> 00:41:22.660
Great.

00:41:22.660 --> 00:41:23.370
﻿We made it safely.

00:41:23.910 --> 00:41:24.960
﻿I'll take right.

00:41:24.960 --> 00:41:25.370
﻿OK.

00:41:25.710 --> 00:41:26.750
﻿I'll aim for the left.

00:41:29.210 --> 00:41:30.460
﻿Cute boy.

00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:32.420
﻿Nice lady.

00:41:41.010 --> 00:41:41.970
﻿What the...

00:41:41.970 --> 00:41:42.850
﻿Stay calm!

00:41:42.850 --> 00:41:43.930
﻿Slowly pull over!

00:41:44.640 --> 00:41:45.390
﻿Right!

00:41:58.870 --> 00:42:00.580
﻿We got a flat tire.

00:42:01.030 --> 00:42:01.790
A﻿nd another here.

00:42:02.620 --> 00:42:04.750
﻿Takagi-kun, contact Shiratori-kun.

00:42:05.290 --> 00:42:05.910
﻿Got it.

00:42:13.050 --> 00:42:14.050
﻿Shit...

00:42:14.050 --> 00:42:15.420
﻿Somebody got here first.

00:42:16.300 --> 00:42:17.470
﻿No use staying, then.

00:42:18.010 --> 00:42:18.760
﻿Move out.

00:42:22.760 --> 00:42:23.850
﻿What?

00:42:23.850 --> 00:42:24.680
﻿No one's there?

00:42:27.060 --> 00:42:29.150
﻿And it doesn't look like she just went out for a while?

00:42:29.480 --> 00:42:30.310
﻿Right.

00:42:30.310 --> 00:42:32.610
﻿The room has been trashed.

00:42:32.610 --> 00:42:36.150
﻿It appears the suspect abducted Shindou-san and fled.

00:42:37.950 --> 00:42:39.780
﻿Requesting backup ASAP.

00:42:40.740 --> 00:42:42.410
﻿Please call for the forensics team.

00:42:42.410 --> 00:42:43.330
﻿﻿Roger.

00:42:43.330 --> 00:42:43.740
﻿Thanks.

00:42:44.790 --> 00:42:45.830
﻿Takagi-kun...

00:42:46.660 --> 00:42:47.210
﻿What is it?

00:42:49.580 --> 00:42:50.750
﻿Satou-san?

00:43:00.510 --> 00:43:01.180
﻿Disguised as an officer?

00:43:01.510 --> 00:43:01.970
﻿Yeah.

00:43:02.600 --> 00:43:04.640
﻿Their codename is Irish.

00:43:04.640 --> 00:43:05.430
﻿Heard it before?

00:43:06.020 --> 00:43:06.890
No...

00:43:06.890 --> 00:43:07.930
Never.

00:43:08.520 --> 00:43:09.140
I see.

00:43:09.890 --> 00:43:11.940
﻿If only I had something on Irish...

00:43:11.940 --> 00:43:13.190
﻿I could deduce their disguise.

00:43:13.190 --> 00:43:14.480
﻿You should stop.

00:43:15.690 --> 00:43:19.950
﻿If it's true that this "Irish" has disguised as an officer...

00:43:19.950 --> 00:43:25.490
﻿They would've been alerted to your running
﻿after Vermouth following the conference.

00:43:25.490 --> 00:43:26.330
﻿Yeah...

00:43:26.330 --> 00:43:26.790
But...

00:43:26.950 --> 00:43:28.410
﻿Don't you get it!?

00:43:28.410 --> 00:43:30.460
﻿The more cases you solve...

00:43:30.460 --> 00:43:33.840
﻿The more likely it is that they'll see you're Kudou Shinichi!

00:43:33.840 --> 00:43:34.670
﻿Ai-kun.

00:43:44.930 --> 00:43:47.020
﻿I know what you're worried about.

00:43:47.520 --> 00:43:48.140
But...

00:43:48.600 --> 00:43:50.440
﻿This isn't something I can leave unsolved.

00:43:50.440 --> 00:43:53.270
﻿This now concerns the life of the officer Irish has disguised as.

00:43:55.400 --> 00:43:56.520
A﻿t any rate...

00:43:56.520 --> 00:44:01.280
﻿There's no doubt that Irish already
﻿infiltrated that police conference.

00:44:01.990 --> 00:44:04.950
﻿I need to do anything to expose their identity...

00:44:05.280 --> 00:44:07.790
﻿Catch the culprit before them...

00:44:08.330 --> 00:44:11.250
﻿And get the memory card their NOC was carrying.

00:44:11.960 --> 00:44:14.420
﻿That one, single card...

00:44:14.420 --> 00:44:16.960
﻿May just be the trump card that crushes them.

00:44:17.670 --> 00:44:19.800
﻿But can you trust it?

00:44:19.800 --> 00:44:21.220
﻿What Vermouth said.

00:44:22.090 --> 00:44:25.300
﻿She's already aware that Haibara is Sherry.

00:44:25.300 --> 00:44:27.180
﻿She may even know my identity as well.

00:44:28.010 --> 00:44:30.180
﻿But, for whatever reason, she's kept
﻿it quiet from the Organization.

00:44:31.310 --> 00:44:32.980
﻿I have no choice but to trust her for now.

00:44:33.900 --> 00:44:37.150
﻿In contrast, she'd call you out to 
﻿The shrine like she's leery of you.

