00:51:18.470 --> 00:51:19.430
﻿﻿﻿That should do it.

00:51:20.090 --> 00:51:23.300
﻿﻿﻿What gets me is the message "Tanabata...Kyo."

00:51:23.810 --> 00:51:24.930
﻿﻿﻿What does that...

00:51:29.100 --> 00:51:30.900
