00:56:14.300 --> 00:56:14.720
﻿Sure.

00:56:15.390 --> 00:56:18.470
﻿And, please give me your cellphone number too, Sawamura-san.

00:56:18.470 --> 00:56:19.060
﻿All right.

00:56:24.980 --> 00:56:25.980
﻿Hello, Hattori?

00:56:26.480 --> 00:56:27.820
﻿Oh, Kudou!

00:56:27.820 --> 00:56:29.150
﻿This is big, very big!

00:56:29.150 --> 00:56:29.940
﻿Crazy big!

00:56:30.780 --> 00:56:33.860
﻿The names of the seven victims you sent...

00:56:33.860 --> 00:56:37.200
﻿Match the names of the guests
 ﻿on the sixth floor during the fire.

