00:57:18.530 --> 00:57:19.450
﻿One sec!

00:57:26.380 --> 00:57:28.840
﻿It says the elevator's capacity is limited to seven people.

00:57:28.840 --> 00:57:30.340
﻿What's this about, Kudou?

00:57:36.180 --> 00:57:37.260
﻿I'll get out, I'll get out!

00:57:40.310 --> 00:57:41.220
﻿I see...

00:57:41.220 --> 00:57:42.600
﻿I get it, Kudou.

00:57:42.600 --> 00:57:43.480
﻿Yeah.

00:57:43.480 --> 00:57:45.230
﻿Most likely, on the night of the fire...

00:57:45.230 --> 00:57:46.600
﻿Honjou Nanako-san was...

00:57:46.600 --> 00:57:49.150
﻿Pushed out of the elevator after boarding it.

00:57:49.770 --> 00:57:52.230
﻿Because the eighth person wanted to get in...

00:57:52.230 --> 00:57:53.240
She was forced out.

00:57:54.990 --> 00:57:56.860
﻿The eighth person would be...

00:57:56.860 --> 00:57:58.660
﻿The one with the 1-pin tile, Jinno-san.

